    folder and replace the 'Invector@FreeClimb\" animator controller\r\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD:
    https://drive.google.com/open?id=12gQGdCw7gwxdAqQSn4PLdkldTEpM4qTV\r\r\n\r\nps*
    Don't forget to also extract the .meta files "
